# Scoring System Implementation

## Overview
The Scoring System calculates and tracks points earned during battle based on various criteria:
- Node control duration
- Enemy battalion elimination
- Network control bonuses

## Sub-Features

### Node Control Points [test-passing]
- Requirements:
  - Award points for controlling network nodes
  - Points should accumulate over time based on control duration
  - Different node types may award different point rates
